    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Ravisin is a frost druid who has given herself entirely to Auril and the destruction of those she blames for her twin sister Vurnis's death. Hunters from Lonelywood killed Vurnis near the forest edge. Ravisin has never forgiven them.</p>\n<p>She has made the elven tomb in the Lonelywood forest her lair and used <em>awaken</em> to gift several beasts with intelligence: the plesiosaurus in Maer Dualdon, the white moose Karra and Venn, and others.</p>\n<p><strong>Motivation:</strong> Forest free of loggers and hunters. Blames Ten-Towns for Vurnis's death.</p>\n<p><strong>Dying words:</strong> \"My beasts will avenge us!\"</p>\n<p><strong>DM:</strong> The awakened shrub (berry bush) in E9 knows everything \u2014 Vurnis's story, her body in E4, that the plesiosaurus had \"scruples.\" Treats it kindly and it talks.</p>"
      },
