        "description": {
          "value": "<p>9th-level WIS spellcaster. DC 14, +6 to hit.</p><p><strong>Cantrips:</strong> druidcraft, guidance, resistance</p><p><strong>1st (4):</strong> animal friendship, fog cloud, speak with animals</p><p><strong>2nd (3):</strong> animal messenger, moonbeam, pass without trace</p><p><strong>3rd (3):</strong> conjure animals, sleet storm, wind wall</p><p><strong>4th (3):</strong> hallucinatory terrain, ice storm</p><p><strong>5th (1):</strong> awaken</p><p><strong>Tactics:</strong> Opens with Moonbeam round 1. Healing Word (bonus) on Karra/Venn. Sleet storm if cornered. Barkskin on herself. Fights to the death.</p>"
